function [load] = power_load(load_w, p_mtq, p_rw, p_rcs)
%POWER_LOAD  The load on the bus [W]: the platform's own load_w and the ADCS's coils, rotors and thrusters.
%   load_w: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   p_mtq: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   p_rw: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   p_rcs: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   returns load: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   Generated by tools/pcode.py from the pseudocode (trinetra-pcode/2); do not edit.
